9,Languages of Eritrea,https://grokipedia.com/page/Languages_of_Eritrea,"Nilo-Saharan languages include Kunama (Kunama ethnic, 4%) and Nara (Nara ethnic, 2%), together representing around 6% of speakers.",Kunama,Nilo-Saharan
